      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "we current support deflate compression which is good enuf for most purposes.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But would be nice to also support gzip (easy given deflate - basically same but diff header), and identity (trivial) - and Compostite (i haven’t found a sampel/test case for this and I can see no reason to ever do it but it appears supported by http standard).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
